  "description": "<p>25 charges.</p><ul><li>Magic Missile (1 charge), Invisibility (2), Lightning Bolt (3), Fireball (3), Dispel Magic (3), Teleport (5).</li><li>Spells are cast at the wielder's caster level and DC, or at caster level 12 and <strong>DC 18</strong> in the hands of a non-caster.</li><li>The wielder has <strong>Advantage</strong> on saves against spells; each spell it saves against restores charges equal to the spell's level (up to 25).</li><li>As an action, break it: every creature within <strong>30ft</strong> takes <strong>1d6</strong> force damage per remaining charge (max <strong>12d6</strong>), Reflex <strong>DC 15</strong> half; the wielder makes the save with <strong>Disadvantage</strong>.</li></ul><p>Rarity: Very Rare</p>",
